# Keyword reminder text records, built from the Comprehensive Rules (effective 2026-08-07; full text in tools/agents/reference/MTG_COMP_RULES_20260807.txt; rules 701 = keyword actions, 702 = keyword abilities) and the Oracle lines of the Forge card scripts. reminder_text = the most common parenthesised reminder wording printed directly after the keyword at the start of a rules line, numbers shown as N and costs as {C}. cards_with = cards using that exact wording; cards_any = cards with any reminder wording for the keyword. Empty reminder_text = no card in the pool prints reminder text for it (read the rule in the CR). coverage: in_reference = also in the user's keyword document or the Claude-added block of KEYWORD_REFERENCE.toon; cr_only = only in the Comprehensive Rules (missing from our reference).
